          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "சிசு — cicu — \"an infant\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "சிசு அமைதியாகத் தூங்கியது. cicu amaitiyākat tūṅkiyatu. The infant slept peacefully."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Written and medical; at home குழந்தை or பாப்பா."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "சிசு (cicu) is borrowed from Sanskrit śiśu, \"a child\" (CDIAL 12476)."
            }
          ]
        },
